      "Air-driven erection: four pendulous vanes over exhaust slots, using about 4 inHg suction.",
      "Electric erection: mercury switches and torque motors. Each motor sits 90° from the axis it corrects.",
      "Normal erection is about 4°/min. Fast erection is about 120°/min.",
      "Electric horizons cut out erection beyond about 10° of bank or 0.18 g to limit turning and acceleration errors.",
