      "Cost index = hourly operating cost ÷ fuel cost. CI 0 = maximum range and minimum trip fuel.",
      "EXEC makes a modification active. DEL and CLR remove data, and DIR INTC flies direct to or intercepts a leg.",
      "FMC present position comes from the IRS/INS positions. A long ground delay can cause a map error that needs re-alignment.",
